<!-- Exploration Age uniques: the Condottiero line, the Galea di Santo Stefano, and the Maestro,
     the trainable half of Tuscany's unique Great Person class (see greatpeople.xml).

     Condottiero combat is +3 over the Swordsman / Man-at-Arms / Pikeman it replaces (38 / 43 / 48
     against 35 / 40 / 45). The base game's range for a unique runs from +0, which is the median
     across its 130 unique/base pairs, to +5 at the ceiling; +3 sits above the middle without
     topping it. It was +2 and cost 10 more production than the standard line, which made it a
     Swordsman that cost more, and it died to everything. Production is now +5 over the line, and
     upkeep is one above it at every tier: a condottiere was hired, and went home when the pay
     stopped. -->
